Accelerator Health is a systems runtime that interprets the operational
health of compute accelerators. It consumes raw observations and produces
authoritative, evidence-based health judgments. It does not transmit
telemetry; it has no network egress other than the explicitly enabled
coordinator/worker control channel documented in the README.
